  speakerName: 
  storyText: "SURVIVOR IDENTITY\r\n    \r\n        \"What was your life before the screaming started?\""
  narrativeBeats:
  - "POLICE OFFICER\r\n            \r\n                You served on the force. Trained to handle firearms under extreme stress. \n\r\n                \"Protect and Serve\" is just a memory. Now, it's \"Aim and Fire.\"\r\n            \r\n            \r\n                PERKS: Steady Hands & Authority\n\r\n                START: Glock 19, Ammo x24"
  - "CONSTRUCTION\r\n            \r\n                You built this city, and you know how to break it. You are physically powerful. \n\r\n                Subtlety is not your strong suit. Force is.\r\n            \r\n            \r\n                PERKS: Breacher & Iron Grip\n\r\n                START: Sledgehammer, Duct Tape"
  - "BURGLAR\r\n            \r\n                You move silently and leave before anyone knows you were there. \n\r\n                Why fight when you can just take what you want?\r\n            \r\n            \r\n                PERKS: Locksmith & Ghost\n\r\n                START: Lockpicks, Knife, Light"
  - "DOCTOR\r\n            \r\n                You know exactly how the human body works\u2014and how to take it apart. \n\r\n                Knowledge is the only resource that doesn't run out.\r\n            \r\n            \r\n                PERKS: Field Medic & Anatomist\n\r\n                START: Medkit, Antibiotics"
  - "MANAGER\r\n            \r\n                A natural leader. You can talk your way out of a gunfight and barter for life. \n\r\n                Humans are the real threat. You know how to handle them.\r\n            \r\n            \r\n                PERKS: Silver Tongue & Inspiration\n\r\n                START: Luxury Watch, Golf Club"
  - "STUDENT\r\n            \r\n                A blank slate with infinite potential. You adapt faster than anyone else. \n\r\n                You define your own survival.\r\n            \r\n            \r\n                PERKS: Fast Learner & Adrenaline\n\r\n                START: Baseball Bat, Textbook"
  dialogueLines: []
  initialFloorItems: []
  choices: []
